  "alt": "A reranked request in four steps. Embedding the query takes about fifty milliseconds and retrieving a hundred vectors takes milliseconds, so the first stage is fast. Reranking a hundred pairs with a cross-encoder can add hundreds of milliseconds before the answer starts streaming.",
  "caption": "Retrieval is fast; the cross-encoder is where the clock starts. Cutting the candidates from 100 to 50 or self-hosting the reranker buys time back.",
